{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/26347bf8e5080fa3df57995cd0a0cef9.avif?t=1754636500\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no reason in this game. <strong>Just blow up everything in front of you.</strong> Feel the primal fun without thinking or worrying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no deep worldview, no contemplation or criticism of the real world. There are no skill combinations or complex controls; just advance and destroy everything you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complicated rules, grand goals, or special meanings\u2014only destruction exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you ride a powerful tank, and there are enemies and buildings. Demolish the buildings in the game and, as a bonus, take down the enemies too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/adf24d53106ca975b24ccfca87753324.poster.avif?t=1754636500\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/adf24d53106ca975b24ccfca87753324.webm?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/adf24d53106ca975b24ccfca87753324.mp4?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to think complicated thoughts. If you see an enemy in front of you, just eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That is your entire purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/3c780367775a2781e0fd4057dfb3b3c5.poster.avif?t=1754636500\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/3c780367775a2781e0fd4057dfb3b3c5.webm?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/3c780367775a2781e0fd4057dfb3b3c5.mp4?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how far away you attack, <strong>they cannot escape you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/28ff1ef908eae9b3a0e3d36e99a121fc.poster.avif?t=1754636500\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/28ff1ef908eae9b3a0e3d36e99a121fc.webm?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/28ff1ef908eae9b3a0e3d36e99a121fc.mp4?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not only enemies, but even walls cannot stop you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's an enemy or a wall blocking your path, destroy everything and keep advancing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852940?t=1754636500","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/0016de6fb144d189203a86208d8eefc12d6cacf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754636500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/91c333fb431d58f7b12c8ce1513ad7632ded9417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754636500","capsule_ima