hink complicated thoughts. If you see an enemy in front of you, just eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That is your entire purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/3c780367775a2781e0fd4057dfb3b3c5.poster.avif?t=1754636500\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/3c780367775a2781e0fd4057dfb3b3c5.webm?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/3c780367775a2781e0fd4057dfb3b3c5.mp4?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how far away you attack, <strong>they cannot escape you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/28ff1ef908eae9b3a0e3d36e99a121fc.poster.avif?t=1754636500\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/28ff1ef908eae9b3a0e3d36e99a121fc.webm?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852940/extras/28ff1ef908eae9b3a0e3d36e99a121fc.mp4?t=1754636500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not only enemies, but even walls cannot stop you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's an enemy or a wall blocking your path, destroy everything and keep advancing.</p>","developers":["clcmd9701"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/